6	 # Objective ledger
7	 
8	-The pure rubbing ledger of §4 with duel settlement (§11's theft and PvP gold) and §12's recovery caches. `@pirate-sea-race/simulation/objectives` has the state, the operations and the invariant. `@pirate-sea-race/content/objectives` has the types, rubbing ids, timings, the gold rule and the zod validators for source sites and assignments. It is plain integer data with no clocks and no `Math.random`. Time is the world tick (20 per second), supplied by the caller. Positions are integer sub-units, supplied by the caller. Nothing here is wired into `MatchRoom` yet.
9	+The pure rubbing ledger of §4 with duel settlement (§11's theft and PvP gold), §12's recovery caches and §11's small match economy. `@pirate-sea-race/simulation/objectives` has the state, the operations and the invariant. `@pirate-sea-race/content/objectives` has the types, rubbing ids, timings, the gold and economy rules and the zod validators for source sites and assignments. It is plain integer data with no clocks and no `Math.random`. Time is the world tick (20 per second), supplied by the caller. Positions are integer sub-units, supplied by the caller. Nothing here is wired into `MatchRoom` yet.
10	 
11	 ## Content
12	 
